Ecosystem: Ethereum staking ecosystem; DeFi (Aave, Curve, Maker, Yearn); L2s (Arbitrum, Optimism, Base); restaking (EigenLayer integration via wstETH) (HIGH) [Lido Blog, https://blog.lido.fi/ecosystem/]

